                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Rural Health Transformation Fund, created under H.R. 1, provides a historic $50 billion for America\u2019s rural healthcare system. \n\nIdahoans, regardless of how rural their community is, should have access to quality care close to home\u2014this provision helps deliver just that.",
