                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Mifepristone kills and endangers women\u2019s health.\n\nIt is alarming that a new variation of this life-terminating drug was approved while a safety review of its dangerous health implications is under review.\n\nAll life is precious, and I will continue to do everything I can in Congress to protect both expecting mothers and the unborn.",
